                <pb facs="1143" n="1023" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg1023"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.51/749: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Representative on Special Mission in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Crowder</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-04-11T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 11,
                                1922—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>24. Your April 8, 4 p.m. Department approves presentation of memorandum
                    transmitted with your despatch of April 5, and presentation of memorandum as
                    outlined in your telegram, except <pb facs="1144" n="1024" xml:id="pg1024"/> for
                    last paragraph of concluding portion. It desires that this paragraph should read
                    as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The compliance with this patriotic duty, the incorporation into the
                            budget for 1921–23 [<hi rendition="#italic">1922–23?</hi>] of the
                            necessary reforms, the congressional approval of that budget before June
                            30th next, would be heralded by my government as a real demonstration in
                            this field of successful republican government in Cuba. The failure to
                            give that demonstration under so clear a necessity would be fatal to the
                            possibility of averting imminent financial disaster to the Cuban
                            Treasury, and could not but be regarded by my Government with the
                            gravest concern.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
